      <h1>Your AI Technology Is Ready. But Is Your Business Ready to Take It to Market?</h1>
      <p class="hero-deck">AI leadership is not just about building the technology. It is about connecting business strategy, innovation, brand positioning, product development and commercial execution.</p>
      <div class="byline"><strong>Lisa Warren</strong><span class="dot"></span><span>Founder &amp; CEO, Neural Horizons AI</span><span class="dot"></span><span>8 min read</span></div>
      <div class="hero-tags"><span class="tag">PAD</span><span class="tag">Innovation POD</span><span class="tag">POC → POR</span><span class="tag">Brand positioning</span><span class="tag">Go-to-Market</span></div>
