      <div class="sidebar-cta">
        <p>Have an AI opportunity but need clarity on where to start?</p>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:lisa@neuralhorizonsai.com?subject=AI%20strategy%20conversation">Start a conversation ↗</a>
      </div>
